<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bk sets warrants on China Res.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bk sets warrants on China Res.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Wednesday it issued 100 million American-style warrants exercisable into 10 million shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$19.26	 PREMIUM	   15.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.5457	GEARING	   4X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.MAR.98	PAYDATE	   19.MAY.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$21.40	 LISTING DATE    21.May.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG	EXER LOT	  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
